{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17093","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 柳公绰","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃源千里远，花洞四时春。\n中有含真客，长爲不死人。\n松高枝叶茂，鹤老羽毛新。\n莫遣同篱槿，朝荣暮化尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳公绰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}